      "views": [
        {
          "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
          "markdown": "**One tweak for Instagram and YouTube**, switched per app from Settings.\n\nInstall one thing and update one thing. Settings › Albrhi lists every app it patches with a switch each, so turning it off inside an app needs no uninstalling and loses no settings.",
          "useSpacing": true
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSpacerView",
          "spacing": 12
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionHeaderView",
          "title": "Beta"
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
          "markdown": "Tested on Instagram **410, 439 and 441**, and YouTube **21.30.5**. Nothing here is pinned to a version number: the tweak looks for what it needs while the app runs, so other versions should work too.",
          "useSpacing": true
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSeparatorView"
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSubheaderView",
          "title": "Choose per app",
          "useBoldText": true
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
          "markdown": "Settings › Albrhi lists every app Albrhi patches, with a switch each. Turn one off and Albrhi does nothing inside that app — without uninstalling anything, and with your settings kept for when you turn it back on. Close and reopen the app for a change to take effect.",
          "useSpacing": true
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSpacerView",
          "spacing": 8
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSubheaderView",
          "title": "Instagram",
          "useBoldText": true
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
          "markdown": "A download button in every post and reel, a Download Center with a real queue, a feed without ads or suggestions, watching stories without telling anyone, confirmations before a mis-tap becomes a notification, custom date formats and an OLED theme.",
          "useSpacing": true
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSpacerView",
          "spacing": 8
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSubheaderView",
          "title": "YouTube",
          "useBoldText": true
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
          "markdown": "Downloads with their own player and a Download Centre tab beside Home and You, no ads, SponsorBlock with coloured markers, playback that keeps going in the background and on the lock screen, and a quality ceiling per connection.",
          "useSpacing": true
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSpacerView",
          "spacing": 8
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSubheaderView",
          "title": "One package",
          "useBoldText": true
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
          "markdown": "Everything in a single install, updated in one place. New Albrhi tweaks arrive here and appear in the same list, so there is never a second thing to install.",
